{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fight with a physics-powered, webcam based motion-controlled combat experience that turns your real-world hand movements into in-game strikes. Using advanced hand landmark tracking and real-time 3D recreation, every jab, swipe, and block becomes a weapon against relentless, liquid-metal enemies straight out of a dystopian future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Hand Tracking:</strong> Built with homuler\u2019s Mediapipe for Unity plugin, your actual hand is recreated in-game with dynamic physics spheres for full motion interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:</strong> Face off against waves of T-1000\u2013like enemies that latch on, strike, and react to every hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Test your endurance against never-ending attackers while racking up points and calories burned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fitness Meets Fighting:</strong> Integrated calorie tracking keeps your workout stats front and center.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive Audio:</strong> Sound effects and in-game music keep the energy high with every punch and impact.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is only the beginning \u2014 our roadmap includes new enemy types, new environments, PvP, story mode, better tracking, and other features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to catch these hands?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953190?t=1756908187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953190/c58a389c8d1b193906a332a338dbb938c79a6e0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756908187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953190/a2938b0de67e4af182400f49b90c98140c597376/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756908187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953190/a2938b0de67e4af182400f49b90c98140c597376/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756908187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fight with a physics-powered, webcam based motion-controlled combat experience that turns your real-world hand movements into in-game strikes. Using advanced hand landmark tracking and real-time 3D recreation, every jab, swipe, and block becomes a weapon against relentless, liquid-metal enemies straight out of a dystopian future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Hand Tracking:</strong> Built with homuler\u2019s Mediapipe for Unity plugin, your actual hand is recreated in-game with dynamic physics spheres for full motion interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:</strong> Face off against waves of T-1000\u2013like enemies that latch on, strike, and react to every hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Test your endurance against never-ending attackers while racking up points and calories burned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fitness Meets Fighting:</strong> Integrated calorie tracking keeps your workout stats front and center.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive Audio:</strong> Sound effects and in-game music keep the energy high with every punch and impact.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is only the beginning \u2014 our roadmap includes new enemy types, new environments, PvP, story mode, better tracking, and other features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to catch these hands?</p>","developers":["MissilexCrisis"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953190/360841e47cee70a4b55131dcf32d6d4842bf7777/header.jpg?t=1756908187","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257190885,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190885/movie480.mp4?t=1756771651","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190885/movie_max.mp4?t=1756771651"},"name":"Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190885/9e00de71a0ab6b971568cce443d7ba97a9838dd6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756771651","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190885/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756771651","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190885/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756771651"}}],"name":"Catch These Hands","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7-1195G7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Xe Graphics G7</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["MissilexCrisis"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"September 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953190/78bf23683e704cc2242eb3432510a056e56772d6/ss_78bf23683e704cc2242eb3432510a056e56772d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756908187","path_thumbnail":"htt